msgid "Aether emitted by unstable elemental crystals is sending even the most docile of creatures into uncontrollable fits of madness. The condition appears to be irreversible, with a swift end the only means of granting these poor souls mercy."
msgstr "Эфир нестабильных элементальных кристаллов сводит с ума даже самых мирных зверей. Похоже, безумие уже не вылечить. Остаётся лишь быстро избавить бедолаг от мучений."

#. ja: 異臭の華族「エクセントリック・イヴ」
#. de: Luftverschmutzung
#. fr: Défi<nbsp>: efflorescence fétide
#. column 1: There is something rotten in the air and it is literally leaving visitors to the Diadem with a not-so-fresh feeling. The culprit? A monstrous morbol known as Eccentric Eve. The solution? Her immediate slaying. Freshness has never been simpler.
msgctxt "Fate:1041:0:0"
msgid "Hail to the E"
msgstr "Да здравствует Ева!"

#. ja: 数多くのバルブが芽吹いたことで<br>大型ルナンティシーが歓喜の異臭を放っている<br>異臭の華族、エクセントリック・イヴを倒せ
#. de: Ein fauler Geruch liegt in der Luft und dringt in die Nasen der Besucher des Diadems. Der Übeltäter? Ein riesiger Morbol, der als exkzentrische Eve bekannt ist. Die Lösung? Ihre sofortige Beseitigung!
#. fr: Membre de la famille des lunantishee, Ève l'excentrique est connue pour émettre les odeurs les plus pestilentielles à plusieurs malms à la ronde. Si rien n'est fait pour l'empêcher de nuire, tous les morbols de l'univers risquent de vouloir déménager au Diadème<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Hail to the E
msgctxt "Fate:1041:0:1"
msgid "There is something rotten in the air and it is literally leaving visitors to the Diadem with a not-so-fresh feeling. The culprit? A monstrous morbol known as Eccentric Eve. The solution? Her immediate slaying. Freshness has never been simpler."
msgstr "В воздухе что-то гниёт, и посетителям Диадемы от этого совсем не свежо. Виновница — огромная морболиха по имени Эксцентричная Ева. Решение простое: немедленно её прикончить. Свежий воздух гарантирован."

#. ja: 消臭力尽く
#. de: Lunantishees in der Luft
#. fr: Entreprise de désodorisation
#. column 1: Extreme levels of ambient aether can not only lead to the increased size and ferocity of a creature, but also to enhanced fertility. Case in point: the Diadem currently finds itself overrun with lunantishee seedlings who, if not dealt with swiftly, will grow into a veritable army of bloodsucking shrubbery.
msgctxt "Fate:1042:0:0"
msgid "Lunantishee in the Sky"
msgstr "Лунантиши в небесах"

#. ja: 環境エーテルが濃密になったことで<br>ルナンティシーが異常に繁殖しつつある<br>ルナンティシー・シードリングを倒せ
#. de: Die hohe Ätherdichte hat zu einer rapiden Zunahme der Lunantishee-Population geführt. Befreie die Inselgruppe von den Plagegeistern!
#. fr: Les environnements à forte densité d'éther n'ont pas que des avantages. En effet, ce genre de conditions naturelles est idéal pour les pousses de lunantishee, qui se font un plaisir d'y proliférer à grande vitesse. Débarrassez l'archipel de ces nuisibles<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Lunantishee in the Sky
msgctxt "Fate:1042:0:1"
msgid "Extreme levels of ambient aether can not only lead to the increased size and ferocity of a creature, but also to enhanced fertility. Case in point: the Diadem currently finds itself overrun with lunantishee seedlings who, if not dealt with swiftly, will grow into a veritable army of bloodsucking shrubbery."
msgstr "Из-за высокой концентрации эфира лунантиши размножаются с пугающей скоростью. Разберитесь с их ростками, пока Диадему не заполонила целая армия кровососущих кустов."

#. ja: 消臭力尽く
#. de: Lunantishees in der Luft
#. fr: Entreprise de désodorisation
#. column 1: Extreme levels of ambient aether can not only lead to the increased size and ferocity of a creature, but also to enhanced fertility. Case in point: the Diadem currently finds itself overrun with lunantishee seedlings who, if not dealt with swiftly, will grow into a veritable army of bloodsucking shrubbery.
