#. ja: ダイアマイト・ウェディングパーティー
#. de: Wo die Liebe hinfällt
#. fr: Lune de miel sans fin
#. column 1: For the vilekin of the Diadem, every season is mating season, and so it is not rare to come across the cacophonous chittering and chirping that is an ageless mite orgy. A female mite can lay upwards of a thousand eggs in a single clutch, so it is left to brave adventurers to see the spawn never take seed.
msgctxt "Fate:1067:0:0"
msgid "(You're) Having My Mitelings"
msgstr "Скоро будут клещата"

#. ja: 繁殖期を迎えたダイアマイトたちが<br>群れを成して、探索の妨害となっている<br>エイジレス・ダイアマイトとベーンマイトを倒せ
#. de: Es empfiehlt sich, während der Fortpflanzungszeit der alterslosen Schaudermilben das Diadem zu meiden. Sollte sich dennoch ein Erforscher auf die Inseln verirren, muss er damit rechnen, von einer Schar liebestoller Schaudermilben angefallen zu werden. Bring ihnen Manieren bei!
#. fr: Les acari intemporels ont profité de la dernière saison des amours pour fricoter avec des sarcoptes. Depuis, les tourtereaux sont tellement in<shy>sé<shy>pa<shy>ra<shy>bles qu'ils attaquent tous ceux qui osent s'approcher de leur nid douillet.
#. column 0: (You're) Having My Mitelings
msgctxt "Fate:1067:0:1"
msgid "For the vilekin of the Diadem, every season is mating season, and so it is not rare to come across the cacophonous chittering and chirping that is an ageless mite orgy. A female mite can lay upwards of a thousand eggs in a single clutch, so it is left to brave adventurers to see the spawn never take seed."
msgstr "Для тварей Диадема любой сезон — брачный. Поэтому визг и стрекотание вековых клещей, предающихся любовным утехам, тут не редкость. Самка может отложить за раз больше тысячи яиц. Отважным искателям приключений остаётся не дать потомству появиться на свет."

#. ja: ある空賊の受難
#. de: Pirat in Not
#. fr: La détresse d'un pirate
#. column 1: A gods-fearing, mother-loving, goodly sky pirate has fallen from the rigging of his crew's airship. While fate deemed it not his time, and saw him land safely upon a tuft of crownbrush, fortune was not as impressed and made certain that tuft was located right in the middle of one of the Diadem's most deadly isles. Needless to say, the plucky picaroon might require some assistance.
#. column 3: Stranded sky pirate
msgctxt "Fate:1068:0:0"
msgid "Nice Pirates"
msgstr "Хорошие пираты"

#. ja: ディアデム諸島に意図せず漂着した<br>空賊が周辺生物に襲われている<br>遭難した空賊を守れ
#. de: Ein Luftpirat ist aus den Aufbauten des Luftschiffs seiner Mannschaft gefallen. Dabei hat er zunächst Glück im Unglück gehabt und ist auf weichem Kronenkraut gelandet. Leider befindet sich dieses jedoch mitten auf einer der tödlichsten Inseln im Diadem. Der unglückselige Freibeuter könnte also etwas Hilfe gebrauchen.
#. fr: L'aéronef d'un pirate dont la boussole est tombée en panne s'est échoué sur Le Diadème, et il n'a pas fallu longtemps au pauvre malheureux avant de se retrouver aux prises avec des créatures féroces. Aidez-le à survivre dans cet environnement hostile<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Nice Pirates
#. column 3: Stranded sky pirate
msgctxt "Fate:1068:0:1"
msgid "A gods-fearing, mother-loving, goodly sky pirate has fallen from the rigging of his crew's airship. While fate deemed it not his time, and saw him land safely upon a tuft of crownbrush, fortune was not as impressed and made certain that tuft was located right in the middle of one of the Diadem's most deadly isles. Needless to say, the plucky picaroon might require some assistance."
msgstr "Богобоязненный, почитающий матушку и в целом добродушный небесный пират сорвался с оснастки воздушного корабля своей команды. Судьба решила, что ему ещё рано умирать, и он мягко приземлился на пучок кронника. Вот только удача не захотела ему улыбаться: пучок оказался на одном из самых опасных островов Диадема. Похоже, храброму пирату не помешает помощь."

#. ja: 遭難した空賊
#. de: Gestrandeter Luftpirat
#. fr: Pirate égaré
#. column 0: Nice Pirates
#. column 1: A gods-fearing, mother-loving, goodly sky pirate has fallen from the rigging of his crew's airship. While fate deemed it not his time, and saw him land safely upon a tuft of crownbrush, fortune was not as impressed and made certain that tuft was located right in the middle of one of the Diadem's most deadly isles. Needless to say, the plucky picaroon might require some assistance.
msgctxt "Fate:1068:0:3"
msgid "Stranded sky pirate"
msgstr "Застрявший небесный пират"

