#. ja: 失われた雲海
#. de: Hungriger Herensugue
#. fr: Carnivores des nuages
#. column 1: Having lived for a thousand years encountering neither Lalafell nor Hyur, the Diadem's herensugues no longer fear mankind and his weapons of war. In their ignorance have they grown bold, leading to many attacks on newly arrived explorers to the islands. It is time they are reintroduced to the pain that kept their ancestors at bay.
msgctxt "Fate:1082:0:0"
msgid "Hard of Heren"
msgstr "Голодный херензуг"

#. ja: 探索中に大型肉食古代獣に遭遇した<br>冒険者をも獲物とする貪欲の暴君<br>エレンスゲを倒せ
#. de: Ob groß, klein, männlich, weiblich - Herensugue liebt sie alle gleichermaßen: die naiven Erstbesucher des Diadems, die in seinen Rachen laufen. Setze seinem Hunger nach Frischfleisch ein für allemal ein Ende.
#. fr: Les herensugues sont tellement avides de chair fraîche qu'ils feraient n'importe quoi pour se mettre le moindre aventurier sous la dent. Prouvez-leur qu'ils devraient manger plus de légumes.
#. column 0: Hard of Heren
msgctxt "Fate:1082:0:1"
msgid "Having lived for a thousand years encountering neither Lalafell nor Hyur, the Diadem's herensugues no longer fear mankind and his weapons of war. In their ignorance have they grown bold, leading to many attacks on newly arrived explorers to the islands. It is time they are reintroduced to the pain that kept their ancestors at bay."
msgstr "Тысячу лет херензуги Диадема не встречали ни лафеллов, ни хьюров, и теперь уже не боятся людей и их оружия. Отвыкнув от опасности, они осмелели и начали нападать на прибывающих на острова искателей приключений. Пора напомнить им, какой болью отпугивали их предков."

