msgid "The neko bugyo has unleashed a horde of vicious yet oh-so-adorable─but mostly vicious─gaelicats on the mochi pounding site. Adventurers retrieving advent cakes from the mortar will have no time for pussyfooting around, lest they fall prey to the cyclops's hammer."
msgstr "Кошачий переполох с моти"

#. ja: 回収した「モチモチ降神餅」を<br>「餅代官」に<br>速やかに納品せよ
#. de: Liefere die Mochi an den Mochi-Meister.
#. fr: Une fois les mochi en votre possession, allez vite les apporter au maître du mochi.
