#. ja: ミャルナ隊の数
#. de: Patrouille
#. fr: Chasseuse sous les ordres de Myalna
#. column 0: Tojil Annihilation
#. column 1: Though the Singing Bows were able to repel Tojil's onslaught, the creature is far from defeated. They will need to press the advantage and slow the beast's movements to prevent it from escaping again.
msgctxt "Fate:1447:0:3"
msgid "Singing Bows"
msgstr "«Звонкие луки»"

#. ja: ミャルナの狩猟：トヒル猛追撃
#. de: Waldpatrouille: 3. Tojilianischer Krieg
#. fr: Chasse de Myalna<nbsp>: un Tojil courroucé
#. column 1: Sensing that the Singing Bows have gained the upper hand, Tojil withdrew to another part of the forest in order to recover its strength. The pain it has suffered at the hands of the woodland guardians has only strengthened its resolve to slaughter each and every one of them.
#. column 3: Singing Bows
msgctxt "Fate:1448:0:0"
msgid "Tojil Carnage"
msgstr "Резня Тоджила"

#. ja: 傷ついたトヒルが<br>怒りで獰猛さを増しつつ、森を移動している<br>貪食の古代獣、トヒルを猛追撃して倒せ
#. de: Tojil scheint geahnt zu haben, dass die Patrouille ihm nun gefährlich wird und hat sich in einen anderen Teil des Waldes zurückgezogen. Die Wunden, die die Bestie davongetragen hat, befeuern seinen Hass auf die Viera nur noch. Eine harter Kampf steht bevor.
#. fr: Le Tojil blessé essaye de s'enfuir de la forêt avec une énergie accrue. Poursuivez le monstre et abattez-le<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Tojil Carnage
#. column 3: Singing Bows
msgctxt "Fate:1448:0:1"
msgid "Sensing that the Singing Bows have gained the upper hand, Tojil withdrew to another part of the forest in order to recover its strength. The pain it has suffered at the hands of the woodland guardians has only strengthened its resolve to slaughter each and every one of them."
msgstr "Почувствовав, что «Звонкие луки» берут верх, Тоджил отступил в другую часть леса, чтобы восстановить силы. Боль от ран, нанесённых лесными стражами, лишь распалила его жажду перебить их всех до единого."

#. ja: ミャルナ隊の数
#. de: Patrouille
#. fr: Chasseuse de l'unité de Myalna
#. column 0: Tojil Carnage
#. column 1: Sensing that the Singing Bows have gained the upper hand, Tojil withdrew to another part of the forest in order to recover its strength. The pain it has suffered at the hands of the woodland guardians has only strengthened its resolve to slaughter each and every one of them.
msgctxt "Fate:1448:0:3"
msgid "Singing Bows"
msgstr "«Звонкие луки»"

#. ja: ミャルナの狩猟：トヒル猛追撃
#. de: Waldpatrouille: 3. Tojilianischer Krieg
#. fr: Chasse de Myalna<nbsp>: un Tojil courroucé
