msgctxt "Fate:1529:0:3"
msgid "Singing Bows"
msgstr "Поющие луки"

#. ja: ミャルナの狩猟：トヒル討伐
#. de: Waldpatrouille: Der Fall Tojils
#. fr: Chasse de Myalna<nbsp>: l'élimination du Tojil
#. column 1: Tojil prepares to make one final stand against the Singing Bows, who are determined to end the beast's reign of terror, no matter the cost. Now that the creature is cornered, its desperation makes it all the more deadly, and it lashes out wildly, blinded by rage.
#. column 3: Singing Bows
msgctxt "Fate:1530:0:0"
msgid "Tojil Eclipse"
msgstr "Закат Тохила"

#. ja: 追い詰められたトヒルが<br>自らの縄張りで、迎え撃とうとしている<br>ミャルナと共に反撃の古代獣、トヒルを倒せ
#. de: Tojil hat nun der blinde Hass überkommen und in die Enge getrieben, ist die Bestie bereit, bis zum bitteren Ende zu kämpfen. Derweil ist Myalna Bogensang fest entschlossen, das Ungeheuer ein für alle Mal zu erlegen.
#. fr: Le Tojil acculé semble avoir décidé de vous attaquer. Abattez le monstre<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Tojil Eclipse
#. column 3: Singing Bows
msgctxt "Fate:1530:0:1"
msgid "Tojil prepares to make one final stand against the Singing Bows, who are determined to end the beast's reign of terror, no matter the cost. Now that the creature is cornered, its desperation makes it all the more deadly, and it lashes out wildly, blinded by rage."
msgstr "Тохил готовится дать Поющим лукам последний бой. Они же намерены любой ценой покончить с ужасом, который он творит. Загнанный в угол зверь стал ещё опаснее: ослеплённый яростью, он мечется и бросается на всех подряд."

#. ja: ミャルナ隊の数
#. de: Patrouille
#. fr: Chasseuse de l'unité de Myalna
#. column 0: Tojil Eclipse
#. column 1: Tojil prepares to make one final stand against the Singing Bows, who are determined to end the beast's reign of terror, no matter the cost. Now that the creature is cornered, its desperation makes it all the more deadly, and it lashes out wildly, blinded by rage.
msgctxt "Fate:1530:0:3"
msgid "Singing Bows"
msgstr "Поющие луки"

#. ja: 悪童ダエン兄弟：アマロが標的！
#. de: Lausbubengeschichten: Amaros
#. fr: Les frères Daen<nbsp>: amaro en vue<nbsp>!
#. column 1: The Daen brothers get along famously─with each other, of course, not anyone else─in large part due to their shared hobbies. This would be heartwarming, did said hobbies not include setting elder gliders upon innocent amaro.
#. column 3: Equable amaro
msgctxt "Fate:1531:0:0"
msgid "Great Daens"
msgstr "Великие Дэны"

#. ja: フーア族の悪童、ダエン兄弟が、<br>周辺に棲息する魔物をアマロにけしかけた<br>アマロを守り、エルダーグライダーを倒せ
#. de: Die „Daen-Brüder“ - Daen Wyd und Daen Lor - sind zwei berüchtigte Zwillinge vom Feenvolk der Fuath. Ihre Streiche bereiten den Bewohnern Il Mhegs immer allerhand Kopfzerbrechen. Dieses Mal haben sie eine Illusion gerufen, die einem Amaro einen gehörigen Schrecken einjagen soll. Bezwinge den alten Gleiter und beschütze den Amaro vor dem Schabernack!
#. fr: Les frères Daen, fauteurs de troubles notoires, ont courroucé un planeur ancestral et l'ont attiré vers un pauvre amaro qui n'avait rien demandé. Protégez l'amaro placide et calmez le planeur ancestral, par la force si nécessaire.
#. column 0: Great Daens
#. column 3: Equable amaro
msgctxt "Fate:1531:0:1"
msgid "The Daen brothers get along famously─with each other, of course, not anyone else─in large part due to their shared hobbies. This would be heartwarming, did said hobbies not include setting elder gliders upon innocent amaro."
msgstr "Братья Дэны отлично ладят друг с другом… и только друг с другом. Во многом их сближают общие увлечения. Это было бы даже мило, если бы среди них не было натравливания старых планеров на безобидных амаро."

#. ja: おっとりしたアマロ
#. de: Amaro
#. fr: Amaro placide
#. column 0: Great Daens
#. column 1: The Daen brothers get along famously─with each other, of course, not anyone else─in large part due to their shared hobbies. This would be heartwarming, did said hobbies not include setting elder gliders upon innocent amaro.
msgctxt "Fate:1531:0:3"
msgid "Equable amaro"
msgstr "Безмятежный амаро"

#. ja: 悪童ダエン兄弟：ン・モゥが標的！
#. de: Lausbubengeschichten: Nu Mou
#. fr: Les frères Daen<nbsp>: Nu Mou en vue<nbsp>!
#. column 1: The fae penchant for mischief covers everything from harmless pranks to active cruelty, and none are less likely to make any sort of distinction between the two than the Daen twins, who have now chosen to harry a hapless herbalist.
#. column 3: Herb caskets
msgctxt "Fate:1532:0:0"
msgid "Fuath of Habit"
msgstr "Привычные проделки фуатов"

#. ja: フーア族の悪童、ダエン兄弟が、<br>ン・モゥの薬草箱にイタズラしようとしてる<br>ダエン兄弟が作り出した幻影を倒せ
#. de: Die „Daen-Brüder“ - Daen Wyd und Daen Lor - sind zwei berüchtigte Zwillinge vom Feenvolk der Fuath. Ihre Streiche bereiten den Bewohnern Il Mhegs immer allerhand Kopfzerbrechen. Dieses Mal haben sie es auf die Kräuterkisten der Nu Mou abgesehen, die sie zerstören wollen. Vertreibe die Illusionen der Daen und verhindere, dass das Kraut unbrauchbar wird!
#. fr: Les frères Daen, fauteurs de troubles notoires, tourmentent un pauvre herboriste Nu Mou en s'en prenant à ses récoltes. Infligez une correction à ces horribles tourmenteurs.
#. column 0: Fuath of Habit
#. column 3: Herb caskets
msgctxt "Fate:1532:0:1"
msgid "The fae penchant for mischief covers everything from harmless pranks to active cruelty, and none are less likely to make any sort of distinction between the two than the Daen twins, who have now chosen to harry a hapless herbalist."
msgstr "Феи шалят по-разному: от безобидных розыгрышей до откровенной жестокости. Близнецы Дэны особенно не склонны различать одно и другое. На этот раз их жертвой стал несчастный травник."

#. ja: 薬草入りの箱
#. de: Kräuterkisten
#. fr: Caisses d'herbes médicinales
#. column 0: Fuath of Habit
#. column 1: The fae penchant for mischief covers everything from harmless pranks to active cruelty, and none are less likely to make any sort of distinction between the two than the Daen twins, who have now chosen to harry a hapless herbalist.
msgctxt "Fate:1532:0:3"
msgid "Herb caskets"
msgstr "Ящики с травами"

#. ja: 悪童ダエン兄弟：幻惑のローワン
#. de: Lausbubengeschichten: Rowan
#. fr: Les frères Daen<nbsp>: riposte arborescente
#. column 1: Piquing the Daens' curiosity is never, strictly speaking, a <i>good</i> idea, but interfering with their mischief is a sure way to do so. Thus has the interference of martially inclined wanderers and one very tenacious pixie prompted them to devise a fantastical means of testing their would-be challengers.
#. column 3: Ul An of the Lost Spring
msgctxt "Fate:1533:0:0"
msgid "Back and Fuath"
msgstr "Фуаты возвращаются"

#. ja: フーア族の悪童、ダエン兄弟が、<br>周囲に棲息する魔物を呼び出し、けしかけてきた<br>ウル＝アンを守り、ドリーム・ローワンを倒せ
#. de: Die „Daen-Brüder“ - Daen Wyd und Daen Lor - sind zwei berüchtigte Zwillinge vom Feenvolk der Fuath. Ihre Streiche bereiten den Bewohnern Il Mhegs immer allerhand Kopfzerbrechen. Der nächste Streich der Quälgeister sind eine Horde Traum-Rowan, die Ul An mit ihren schweren Ästen peitschen. Zeit, die Säge auszupacken!
#. fr: Les frères Daen, fauteurs de troubles notoires, cherchent à se débarrasser de la Pixie redresseuse de torts qui les poursuit. Protégez Ul An et vainquez les rowans des rêves.
#. column 0: Back and Fuath
#. column 3: Ul An of the Lost Spring
#. macro: <i> — italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </i> — end of: italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "Fate:1533:0:1"
msgid "Piquing the Daens' curiosity is never, strictly speaking, a <i>good</i> idea, but interfering with their mischief is a sure way to do so. Thus has the interference of martially inclined wanderers and one very tenacious pixie prompted them to devise a fantastical means of testing their would-be challengers."
msgstr "Вызывать любопытство Дэнов — вообще-то не самая <i>хорошая</i> идея. А вмешаться в их проделки — верный способ это любопытство пробудить. Вот и любознательные путешественники с боевым настроем да одна невероятно настырная пикси подкинули близнецам идею устроить соперникам необычное испытание."

#. ja: 季春のウル＝アン
#. de: Ul An
#. fr: Ul An du soir-printemps
#. column 0: Back and Fuath
#. column 1: Piquing the Daens' curiosity is never, strictly speaking, a <i>good</i> idea, but interfering with their mischief is a sure way to do so. Thus has the interference of martially inclined wanderers and one very tenacious pixie prompted them to devise a fantastical means of testing their would-be challengers.
msgctxt "Fate:1533:0:3"
msgid "Ul An of the Lost Spring"
msgstr "Уль Ан из Затерянного Истока"

#. ja: 降神祭「モチモチ餅を切り分けろ！」
#. de: Mach das Mochi tot oder ein Gozu sieht rot
#. fr: Le mochi avant les bœufs
#. column 1: Long thought devoured after the previous turn of the heavens, the celebratory mochi turned monster from the Far East has returned. Does it crave revenge? The flesh of unsuspecting Lalafells? It won't matter if you manage to slice it into delectable morsels.
msgctxt "Fate:1537:0:0"
msgid "The Mochi that Ate Vylbrand"
msgstr "Моти, пожравшее Вилбранд"

#. ja: 霊験あらたかな大天山の霊泉が<br>またもや「降神餅」に仮初の命を与えた<br>ゴズに注意しながら、降神餅を切り分けろ
#. de: Das Festtags-Mochi für die Himmelswende hat durch das wunderkräftige Wasser vom Daitenzan wieder ein Eigenleben entwickelt. Zerteile den rabiaten rasenden Reisteigklumpen in mundgerechte Portionen und weiche den Hörnern des Gozu aus!
#. fr: L'eau mystique du Mont Daiten utilisée l'année passée par le maître du mochi s'est imprégnée dans son mortier, ce qui a redonné vie au gluant de riz<nbsp>! À vous de le battre et de le découper en petits morceaux, mais attention au gozu en furie<nbsp>!
#. column 0: The Mochi that Ate Vylbrand
msgctxt "Fate:1537:0:1"
msgid "Long thought devoured after the previous turn of the heavens, the celebratory mochi turned monster from the Far East has returned. Does it crave revenge? The flesh of unsuspecting Lalafells? It won't matter if you manage to slice it into delectable morsels."
msgstr "Все думали, что чудовищное праздничное моти с Дальнего Востока было съедено ещё в прошлом году. Но оно вернулось! Жаждет ли оно мести? Мяса беззаботных лалафеллов? Неважно, если успеешь нарезать его на аппетитные кусочки."

#. ja: 名も無き者たちの広場：第一期整備計画着工
#. de: Platz der Habenichtse: Erste Phase - Beginn
#. fr: Esplanade des démunis, phase 1<nbsp>: début des travaux
#. column 1: Facilities are being built for the restoration effort. Obtain material from a supply pile, process it into a component at a work station, and see it assembled.
#. column 2: Checking contributions...<br>Be warned that you must be a Disciple of the Hand or the Land to receive rewards.
#. column 3: Contribution
msgctxt "Fate:1538:0:0"
msgid "The Mendicant's Court, 1st Stage: First Shift"
msgstr "Двор нищих, этап 1: начало работ"

#. ja: 物資集積場から物資を入手し<br>一次作業場で建築資材に加工して<br>施設の建築を進めろ
#. de: Wir errichten Gebäude, um den Wieder<shy>aufbau Ishgards voranzutreiben. Besorge dir Material von einem der Stapel, verarbeite es an einer Werkbank zu einer der benötigten Komponenten und führe diese dann einer Baustelle zu.
#. fr: On bâtit des ins<shy>tal<shy>la<shy>tions pour la recon<shy>struc<shy>tion d'Azurée. Prenez un matériau sur une pile, transformez-le sur un poste de travail et allez le poser sur un des postes d'assemblage.
#. column 0: The Mendicant's Court, 1st Stage: First Shift
#. column 2: Checking contributions...<br>Be warned that you must be a Disciple of the Hand or the Land to receive rewards.
#. column 3: Contribution
msgctxt "Fate:1538:0:1"
msgid "Facilities are being built for the restoration effort. Obtain material from a supply pile, process it into a component at a work station, and see it assembled."
msgstr "Для восстановления строят новые здания. Возьми материалы со склада, обработай их на рабочем месте и собери из них нужные детали."

#. ja: 復興共同作業の進捗度を確認中<br>ギャザラー、クラフター以外では<br>報酬を受け取れないため注意せよ
#. de: Schauen wir mal, was du bislang beigetragen hast.<br> Aber sei gewarnt: Nur Handwerker und Sammler können vergütet werden.
#. fr: Estimation de la progression des travaux en cours. Attention, seuls les récolteurs et les artisans seront récompensés pour leur con<shy>tri<shy>bu<shy>tion.
#. column 0: The Mendicant's Court, 1st Stage: First Shift
#. column 1: Facilities are being built for the restoration effort. Obtain material from a supply pile, process it into a component at a work station, and see it assembled.
#. column 3: Contribution
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "Fate:1538:0:2"
msgid "Checking contributions...<br>Be warned that you must be a Disciple of the Hand or the Land to receive rewards."
msgstr "Проверяем вклад...<br>Учти: награду получат только ремесленники и собиратели."

#. ja: 作業貢献度
#. de: Arbeitsbeitrag
#. fr: Contribution
#. column 0: The Mendicant's Court, 1st Stage: First Shift
#. column 1: Facilities are being built for the restoration effort. Obtain material from a supply pile, process it into a component at a work station, and see it assembled.
#. column 2: Checking contributions...<br>Be warned that you must be a Disciple of the Hand or the Land to receive rewards.
msgctxt "Fate:1538:0:3"
msgid "Contribution"
msgstr "Вклад в работы"

#. ja: 名も無き者たちの広場：第一期整備計画完工
#. de: Platz der Habenichtse: Erste Phase - Abschluss
#. fr: Esplanade des démunis, phase 1<nbsp>: fin des travaux
#. column 1: Facilities are being built for the restoration effort. Obtain material from a supply pile, process it into a component at a work station, and see it assembled.
#. column 2: Checking contributions...<br>Be warned that you must be a Disciple of the Hand or the Land to receive rewards.
#. column 3: Contribution
msgctxt "Fate:1539:0:0"
msgid "The Mendicant's Court, 1st Stage: Last Shift"
msgstr "Двор нищих, этап 1: завершение работ"

#. ja: 物資集積場から物資を入手し<br>一次作業場で建築資材に加工して<br>施設の建築を進めろ
#. de: Wir errichten Gebäude, um den Wieder<shy>aufbau Ishgards voranzutreiben. Besorge dir Material von einem der Stapel, verarbeite es an einer Werkbank zu einer der benötigten Komponenten und führe diese dann einer Baustelle zu.
