#. de: Kreuzkarst-Spalier: Vierte Phase - Abschluss
#. fr: Le Hoyau, phase 4<nbsp>: fin des travaux
#. column 1: Construction is being carried out on the main thoroughfare connecting the New Nest. Obtain raw material from a supply pile, process it at a work station, and put it to use at building sites.
#. column 2: Checking contributions...<br>Be warned that you must be a Disciple of the Hand or the Land to receive rewards.
