#. fr: Le Nichoir, phase 4<nbsp>: fin des travaux
#. column 1: Repairs are being carried out on the New Nest. Obtain raw material from a supply pile, process it at a work station, and use it to repair damaged areas.
#. column 2: Checking contributions...<br>Be warned that you must be a Disciple of the Hand or the Land to receive rewards.
#. column 3: Contribution
msgctxt "Fate:1565:0:0"
msgid "The New Nest, 4th Stage: Last Shift"
msgstr "Новое гнездо, этап 4: завершение"

#. ja: 物資集積場から物資を入手し<br>一次作業場で土木資材に加工して<br>破損個所の舗装を進めろ
#. de: Wir pflastern das Genist. Besorge dir Material von einem der Stapel, verarbeite es an einer Sandgrube zu Fugensand und führe diesen dann einem Pflasterloch zu.
#. fr: Les fondations ont sacrément été esquintées alors on doit les retaper. Prenez des matériaux sur une pile, transformez-les sur un poste de travail et servez-vous-en sur les emplacements à restaurer.
#. column 0: The New Nest, 4th Stage: Last Shift
#. column 2: Checking contributions...<br>Be warned that you must be a Disciple of the Hand or the Land to receive rewards.
#. column 3: Contribution
msgctxt "Fate:1565:0:1"
msgid "Repairs are being carried out on the New Nest. Obtain raw material from a supply pile, process it at a work station, and use it to repair damaged areas."
msgstr "Ремонтируют Новое гнездо. Возьми материалы со склада, обработай их на рабочем месте и заделай повреждённые участки."

