#. column 2: Checking contributions...<br>Be warned that you must be a Disciple of the Hand or the Land to receive rewards.
#. column 3: Contribution
msgctxt "Fate:1633:0:0"
msgid "Featherfall, 4th Stage: Last Shift"
msgstr "Перепад: этап 4 — завершение работ"

#. ja: 物資集積場から物資を入手し<br>一次作業場で土木資材に加工して<br>破損個所の舗装を進めろ
#. de: Wir pflastern das Federfall-Quartier. Besorge dir Material von einem der Stapel, verarbeite es an einer Sandgrube zu Fugensand und führe diesen dann einem Pflasterloch zu.
#. fr: Le pavage est sacrément esquinté alors on doit le retaper. Prenez des matériaux sur une pile, transformez-les sur un poste de travail et servez-vous-en sur les emplacements à restaurer.
#. column 0: Featherfall, 4th Stage: Last Shift
#. column 2: Checking contributions...<br>Be warned that you must be a Disciple of the Hand or the Land to receive rewards.
#. column 3: Contribution
msgctxt "Fate:1633:0:1"
msgid "Repairs are being carried out in Featherfall. Obtain raw material from a supply pile, process it at a work station, and use it to repair damaged areas."
msgstr "В Перепаде идёт ремонт. Возьмите материалы со склада, обработайте их на рабочей площадке и используйте для починки повреждённых участков."

