#. ja: アバカス通り：第二期整備計画完工
#. de: Allee des Abakus: 2. Phase - Abschluss
#. fr: L'Abaque, phase 2<nbsp>: fin des travaux
#. column 1: Repairs are being carried out on Featherfall's main thoroughfare. Obtain raw material from a supply pile, process it at a work station, and use it to repair damaged areas.
#. column 2: Checking contributions...<br>Be warned that you must be a Disciple of the Hand or the Land to receive rewards.
#. column 3: Contribution
msgctxt "Fate:1642:0:0"
msgid "The Abacus, 2nd Stage: Last Shift"
msgstr "Абак, этап 2: конец работ"

#. ja: 物資集積場から物資を入手し<br>一次作業場で土木資材に加工して<br>破損個所の舗装を進めろ
#. de: Wir pflastern die Allee des Abakus. Besorge dir Material von einem der Stapel, verarbeite es an einer Sandgrube zu Fugensand und führe diesen dann einem Pflasterloch zu.
#. fr: Le pavage est sacrément esquinté alors on doit le retaper. Prenez des matériaux sur une pile, transformez-les sur un poste de travail et servez-vous-en sur les emplacements à restaurer.
#. column 0: The Abacus, 2nd Stage: Last Shift
#. column 2: Checking contributions...<br>Be warned that you must be a Disciple of the Hand or the Land to receive rewards.
#. column 3: Contribution
msgctxt "Fate:1642:0:1"
msgid "Repairs are being carried out on Featherfall's main thoroughfare. Obtain raw material from a supply pile, process it at a work station, and use it to repair damaged areas."
msgstr "На главной улице Перья и водопады ремонтируют покрытие. Возьмите сырьё со склада, обработайте его на рабочем месте и используйте для ремонта повреждённых участков."

#. ja: 復興共同作業の進捗度を確認中<br>ギャザラー、クラフター以外では<br>報酬を受け取れないため注意せよ
#. de: Schauen wir mal, was du bislang beigetragen hast.<br> Aber sei gewarnt: Nur Handwerker und Sammler können vergütet werden.
