#. de: Raureif-Refugium: 1. Phase
#. fr: Retraite de Givreglacé, phase 1
#. column 1: Scaffolds are being built for a new residential district in Featherfall. Obtain raw material from a supply pile, process it at a work station, and see it assembled.
