#. column 2: Checking contributions...<br>Be warned that you must be a Disciple of the Hand or the Land to receive rewards.
#. column 3: Contribution
msgctxt "Fate:1665:0:0"
msgid "Hoarfrost Hall, 3rd Stage"
msgstr "Зал Инея, этап 3"

#. ja: 物資集積場から物資を入手し<br>一次作業場で建築資材に加工して<br>施設の建築を進めろ
#. de: Wir bauen das Wohnhaus im Raureif-Refugium auf. Besorge dir Material von einem der Stapel, verarbeite es an einer Steinsäge zu einem ordentlichen Baustein und führe diesen dann einer Baustelle zu.
#. fr: On bâtit des ins<shy>tal<shy>la<shy>tions pour la recon<shy>struc<shy>tion d'Azurée. Prenez un matériau sur une pile, transformez-le sur un poste de travail et allez le poser sur un des postes d'assemblage.
#. column 0: Hoarfrost Hall, 3rd Stage
#. column 2: Checking contributions...<br>Be warned that you must be a Disciple of the Hand or the Land to receive rewards.
#. column 3: Contribution
msgctxt "Fate:1665:0:1"
msgid "Construction is being carried out in Featherfall's residential district. Obtain raw material from a supply pile, process it at a work station, and put it to use at building sites."
msgstr "В жилом районе Перопада ведут строительство. Возьми материалы со склада, обработай их на рабочем месте и доставь на стройку."

