#. fr: On s'attaque à la con<shy>struc<shy>tion d'habitations dignes de ce nom. Prenez un matériau sur une pile, transformez-le sur un poste de travail et allez le poser sur un des postes d'assemblage.
#. column 0: Western Risensong Quarter, 4th Stage: First Shift
#. column 2: Checking contributions...<br>Be warned that you must be a Disciple of the Hand or the Land to receive rewards.
#. column 3: Contribution
msgctxt "Fate:1673:0:1"
msgid "Construction is being carried out in the Risensong Quarter. Obtain raw material from a supply pile, process it at a work station, and use it to repair damaged areas."
msgstr "В квартале Восходящей песни ведут ремонт. Возьми материалы со склада, обработай их на рабочем месте и заделай повреждённые участки."

#. ja: 復興共同作業の進捗度を確認中<br>ギャザラー、クラフター以外では<br>報酬を受け取れないため注意せよ
#. de: Schauen wir mal, was du bislang beigetragen hast.<br> Aber sei gewarnt: Nur Handwerker und Sammler können vergütet werden.
#. fr: Estimation de la progression des travaux en cours. Attention, seuls les récolteurs et les artisans seront récompensés pour leur con<shy>tri<shy>bu<shy>tion.
#. column 0: Western Risensong Quarter, 4th Stage: First Shift
#. column 1: Construction is being carried out in the Risensong Quarter. Obtain raw material from a supply pile, process it at a work station, and use it to repair damaged areas.
#. column 3: Contribution
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "Fate:1673:0:2"
msgid "Checking contributions...<br>Be warned that you must be a Disciple of the Hand or the Land to receive rewards."
msgstr "Проверяем вклад в общее дело...<br>Награды получат только ремесленники и собиратели."

