#. ja: 紅蓮祭「襲来 アイスボンバード！」
#. de: Angriff der Eis-Knallomaten
#. fr: Des bombardos com<shy>plè<shy>te<shy>ment givrés
#. column 1: Having taken extreme umbrage at being forcefully evicted from their icy home and dragged to the balmy climes of Costa del Sol, a pack of blustery ice Bombards is determined to crash the Moonfire Faire festivities. Take up arms with your fellow adventurers, that revelry and merriment might return to the Isle of Endless Summer.
msgctxt "Fate:1710:0:0"
msgid "A Blizzard of Bombards"
msgstr "Ледяные бомбардировщики атакуют!"

#. ja: 氷の冷気を求めて、アイスボンバードが襲来した<br>浜辺に集った協力者たちとともに<br>アイスボンバードを撃退せよ
#. de: Eis-Knallomaten, die nach einer Abkühlung lechzen, gefährden die geplante Eis-Aktion des Feuermond-Reigens. Vertreibe die hitzigen Biester gemeinsam mit den Helfern, die sich am Strand versammelt haben!
#. fr: Des bombardos nés dans la glace éternelle des régions polaires sont venus gâcher les réjouissances sur l'île de l'Éternel été. Réduisez-les à l'état liquide en compagnie des autres estivaliers<nbsp>!
#. column 0: A Blizzard of Bombards
msgctxt "Fate:1710:0:1"
msgid "Having taken extreme umbrage at being forcefully evicted from their icy home and dragged to the balmy climes of Costa del Sol, a pack of blustery ice Bombards is determined to crash the Moonfire Faire festivities. Take up arms with your fellow adventurers, that revelry and merriment might return to the Isle of Endless Summer."
msgstr "Ледяные бомбардировщики, изгнанные из родных снегов и доставленные в тёплые края Коста-дель-Соль, страшно возмущены и намерены сорвать Праздник Огненного светила. Сражайся бок о бок с другими искателями приключений, чтобы веселье вернулось на остров Вечного лета!"

#. ja: エッグハント「ニワトリの卵は誰のもの」
#. de: Im Hühnerstall der Albträume
#. fr: Marcher sur des œufs
#. column 1: The hens in the Dreamer's Run have finally begun laying their eggs. Collect these freshly laid treasures from the nests while steering clear of the rambunctious roosters.
#. column 2: Deliver the freshly laid eggs to the Hatching-tide helpmeet.
#. column 3: Eggs delivered
msgctxt "Fate:1711:0:0"
msgid "An Eggsistential Threat"
msgstr "Яичная угроза"

#. ja: メンドリたちが産卵の準備をはじめた<br>興奮状態のオンドリたちの猛攻をかわして<br>「産みたて卵」を集めろ
#. de: Die Hennen im Hühnerstall der Träumerin sind legebereit. Sammel ihre nestwarmen Eier ein, aber halte dich von den Hähnen fern!
#. fr: Les poules de Pawlin ont enfin accepté de pondre. Cependant elles ne comptent pas vous laisser chaparder leurs œufs sans se laisser faire. À vous d'en ramasser le plus possible tout en évitant les assauts des gallinacés.
#. column 0: An Eggsistential Threat
#. column 2: Deliver the freshly laid eggs to the Hatching-tide helpmeet.
#. column 3: Eggs delivered
msgctxt "Fate:1711:0:1"
msgid "The hens in the Dreamer's Run have finally begun laying their eggs. Collect these freshly laid treasures from the nests while steering clear of the rambunctious roosters."
msgstr "Куры в Загоне мечтательницы наконец начали нестись. Собирай свежие яйца в гнёздах и остерегайся разбуянившихся петухов!"

#. ja: 手に入れた「産みたて卵」を<br>「エッグハント実行委員」に<br>速やかに納品せよ
#. de: Liefere die Eier ab!
#. fr: Rapportez les œufs frais à l'organisateur de la chasse aux Prœufs.
#. column 0: An Eggsistential Threat
#. column 1: The hens in the Dreamer's Run have finally begun laying their eggs. Collect these freshly laid treasures from the nests while steering clear of the rambunctious roosters.
#. column 3: Eggs delivered
msgctxt "Fate:1711:0:2"
msgid "Deliver the freshly laid eggs to the Hatching-tide helpmeet."
msgstr "Отнеси свежие яйца организатору Созревания яиц."

#. ja: 納品した産みたて卵の数
#. de: Gesammelte Eier
#. fr: Œufs rapportés
#. column 0: An Eggsistential Threat
#. column 1: The hens in the Dreamer's Run have finally begun laying their eggs. Collect these freshly laid treasures from the nests while steering clear of the rambunctious roosters.
#. column 2: Deliver the freshly laid eggs to the Hatching-tide helpmeet.
msgctxt "Fate:1711:0:3"
msgid "Eggs delivered"
msgstr "Сдано яиц"

#. ja: 蒼天街復興祝祭「Fêteへようこそ！」
#. de: Feste, Fêtes und Feierlaune
#. fr: Les poseurs à la feste
#. column 1: Indicate your participation in the fêtes by performing the mascots' poses back at them.<br>[You must be a Disciple of the Hand or the Land to play.]
#. column 3: Points
