#. de: Der Stoff der Träume
#. fr: La fabrique à peluches
#. column 1: Craft stuffed toys using the materials provided, and load them up in the wains at the plaza.<br>[You must be a Disciple of the Hand or the Land to play.]
#. column 2: Be warned that you must be a Disciple of the Hand or the Land to receive rewards.
